# Contracts

PLAN.md frozen shapes are implemented twice so React and FastAPI share one JSON wire format (camelCase).

- `packages/contracts` — Zod + TS for `apps/web`
- `packages/py-contracts` — Pydantic v2 for `apps/api`, `packages/agents`, `packages/sandbox`
- Web imports `@terrarium/contracts`. Python imports `terrarium_contracts`. Never copy DTOs into `apps/*`
- Do not import Docker, LLM SDKs, React, or FastAPI here
